Version:V4.0.4,Date:2023.06.05,Author:xiuxiu.zhang,Review:,Approval:,Description:(Pbox)更新VDHR_IC的ID值为0x277，ADU发送，Cooling和Pbox接收;
Version:V4.0.4,Date:2023.06.05,Author:xiuxiu.zhang,Review:,Approval:,Description:(Pbox)Pbox增加接收Vehicle_State::TachographVehicleSpeed信号;
Version:V4.0.4,Date:2023.06.05,Author:xiuxiu.zhang,Review:,Approval:,Description:(Pbox)更新Pbox报文名称：GPS_Bearing更新为GPS_Heading，信号名称同步更改;
Version:V4.0.4,Date:2023.06.05,Author:xiuxiu.zhang,Review:,Approval:,Description:(Pbox)更新Pbox报文发送周期：GPS_Longitude、GPS_Latitude、GPS_Speed、GPS_Heading、GPS_Location_State由100ms更新为200ms;
Version:V4.0.4,Date:2023.06.05,Author:xiuxiu.zha";
